<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>God needs a group of us to turn the age,</l><l>To fellowship and consecrate,</l><l>To be in oneness — Yes! This is the way,</l><l>No pride or boasting, giving Him first place.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Our testimony in the church today,</l><l>Is the expression of God through man,</l><l>Let’s be the pillars for His dwelling place,</l><l>But don’t be passive — trust in His way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
